{"name":"Mature","hex":"#c4afb3","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"mature","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Fully developed; grown up in terms of physical appearance, behaviour or thinking; ripe.","Brought to a state of complete readiness."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To proceed toward maturity: full development or completion (either of concrete or of abstract things, e.g. plans, judgments, qualities).","To attain maturity, to become mature or ripe."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/mature"}],"entries":[{"title":"Mature (song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Mature\" is a song by the American singer Hilary Duff. It was released on November 6, 2025, by Sugarmouse Inc. and Atlantic Records as the lead single from her sixth studio album, Luck... or Something (2026). She and Madison Love co-wrote the song with its producers Matthew Koma and Brian Phillips. Its lyrics reference Duff's regret for dating an older man."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/ed/Hilary_Duff_%E2%80%93_Mature_%28single_cover%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mature_(song)","wikidata":"Q136723700"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/e/ed/Hilary_Duff_%E2%80%93_Mature_%28single_cover%29.png/250px-Hilary_Duff_%E2%80%93_Mature_%28single_cover%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/ed/Hilary_Duff_%E2%80%93_Mature_%28single_cover%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/e/ed/Hilary_Duff_%E2%80%93_Mature_%28single_cover%29.png/250px-Hilary_Duff_%E2%80%93_Mature_%28single_cover%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHilary_Duff_%E2%80%93_M